                class="sr-only"
                >who is a
              </span>VP of Engineering at LayerX
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section id="connect">
        <h2>Let's connect!</h2>
        <p>
          I'm currently available for <strong>Senior Frontend Engineering</strong> and <strong
            >Accessibility Consulting</strong
          > roles across Europe and globally.
        </p>
        <p>
          My expertise is uniquely positioned to help organizations <strong
            >build accessible Design Systems</strong
          >, <strong>achieve EAA or ADA compliance</strong>, or <strong
            >elevate a team's accessibility maturity</strong
          >. I bring the technical depth and strategic insight to deliver results.
        </p>
        <p>
          Let's build digital products that meet the moment: fast, inclusive, and compliant with
          global accessibility standards—because accessibility isn't a checkbox, it's a competitive
